      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "> **Test fixture.** This board points at `titiler.test`, a host that does not resolve. It exists so the end-to-end suite can intercept its requests; opened by hand the map stays empty, and that is correct.\n\n# Pyramided and temporal Zarr\n\nA `multiscales` pyramid of 6 levels: each zoom asks for its own level through `group`, and beyond the deepest one deck reuses what it has. The store's time axis is not dates but integers in a dimension called `month`, so the query declares both things and the panel translates."
      }
    },
